A value carrying a literal tab and a backslash-n escape round-trips through the file (a real newline cannot cross the argv boundary).

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md "summary=one	two\nthree"
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
+summary: "one\ttwo\\nthree"
 ---
 
 # Foo
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: summary=one	two\nthree
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
summary: "one\ttwo\\nthree"
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
